        "wouldContinue": true,
        "freeText": "The Hidden pixels card appeared at the start of the level, clear and short ('A ? pixel blocks its lane. Finish a pixel next to it to reveal its colour') and it fit on screen. But I had already met '?' pixels on levels 281 and 282, so the card felt a bit late for me. The question-mark buckets under a column turned out useful once revealed. Jam panel text was clear and the '+1 slot' button was obvious there. I got jammed because I mismanaged slots, mostly my fault, though the number badge (arrow with 1!, 2!) is easy to ignore."
