          "rememberedColors": null
        },
        "notUnderstood": "The Stones card finally told me what the grey dice are, but only on level 285 even though they had been on the board since 281. Padlocks and the key still unexplained. I also could not tell why some buckets spent a lot of paint and the board still looked unpainted; the little half-coloured flags on the rim were confusing.",
